# Hallmark for Barsik UI

When designing or redesigning screens in this project:

1. Read `barsik-game/design.md` first (locked system).
2. Follow skill at `.agents/skills/hallmark/SKILL.md` — verbs: default build, `audit`, `redesign`, `study`.
3. Genre: **playful** · theme: **Barsik Hum** (cream + pear + cyan + coral).
4. Hard bans: purple/violet AI defaults, italic display headers, glassmorphism, gradient text, invented metrics, emoji-as-decoration replacing icons.
5. Prefer in-place CSS/token edits; never delete route trees without explicit confirmation.
6. Pre-emit critique stamp in CSS comment: `/* Hallmark · P? H? E? S? R? V? */`
